      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "**用法**：SkyWalking Trace 详情复制 Trace ID → 粘贴到上方变量（只保留前 32 位，如 `13eef851b9434faa8dfcadbeeaa924a7`）→ 时间范围对齐 Trace 发生时刻 ±5 分钟。\n\n**排障顺序**：先在 SkyWalking 看哪一段 Span 报错/变慢，再用本页拉全服务日志。不要固定 `level=INFO`（SQL 等为 DEBUG）。",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "说明",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3
      },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "dedupStrategy": "none",
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "prettifyLogMessage": false,
        "showCommonLabels": true,
        "showLabels": false,
        "showTime": true,
        "sortOrder": "Ascending",
        "wrapLogMessage": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "{service=~\"$moli_services\"} |= \"$trace_id\"",
          "queryType": "range",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "全链路日志（所有级别）",
      "type": "logs"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13
      },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "dedupStrategy": "none",
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "prettifyLogMessage": false,
        "showCommonLabels": true,
        "showLabels": false,
        "showTime": true,
        "sortOrder": "Ascending",
        "wrapLogMessage": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "{service=~\"$moli_services\"} |= \"$trace_id\" |~ \"(?i)(ERROR|Exception|Caused by)\"",
          "queryType": "range",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "全链路异常（ERROR / Exception）",
      "type": "logs"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
